<Text>&lt;font size="16" color= "#FFFFFF" &gt;
Your friends list makes it easy to connect with people on Xbox LIVE. Easily send text and voice messages, start up a private or video chat, or form a party.





&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
To start, just open the Xbox Guide when signed into Xbox LIVE.



&lt;/font&gt;</Text>
